  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(4.24)")
   $ alpha_0 \( R \) = 0 \, #h(2em) alpha_0 \( q in E_i \) = \( 0 \, dots.h \, cal(O)_(E_i) \( q - e_i \) \, dots.h \, 0 \) \, #h(2em) alpha_0 \( \| C_0 \| \) = \| Z_0 \| . $ <p3sw:support-abel-limit>]
