] <p3sw:coherent-sheaf>

#proof[
  For $m = \( x \, N \)$, Proposition 22 gives
  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(4.39)")
   $ 0 arrow.r cal(F)_m arrow.r cal(M)_(x \, N) arrow.r cal(O)_(Z_x) ⊗ cal(M)_(x \, N) arrow.r 0 . $ <p3sw:support-fiber-exact>]
