  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(4.40)")
   $ h^0 \( X \, cal(M)_(x \, N) \) = chi \( X \, cal(M)_(x \, N) \) = integral_X frac(\( 2 Theta \)^3, 3 !) = 8 . $ <p3sw:support-ambient-euler>]
