  #[#set math.equation(numbering: n => "(4.41)")
   $ H^3 \( cal(F)_m \) = 0 \, #h(2em) H^2 \( cal(F)_m \) = H^1 \( Z_x \, cal(M)_(x \, N) \|_(Z_x) \) . $ <p3sw:support-degree-two-fiber>]
